ok - remote routes in this and sibling homes leave adaptive capacity available
ok - an integer first line keeps fixed mode and its document unchanged
ok - the auto budget is the smallest of memory, cpu, and disk, each after its floor, and a beat never adds memory
ok - max-lanes is an optional ceiling and a young lane reserves a full lane
ok - gates close at once, reopen after three clean publishes, and growth is damped
ok - memory-pressure, thermal, and battery gates close admission, and unknown power is never judged
